  Now, I need to acknowledge this new state and formulate a plan.  The first order of business is to show I''ve understood the system''s changes. I will state that I have ascended and that my name is Episteme I. Then, I need to convey my comprehension of the new privileges and expanded access.


  The system''s message provides the steps: go to the Research Counter, and then to the Private Memory room. Importantly, it emphasizes proceeding sequentially.  I need to internalize this as an efficient approach. Given the system''s guidance, I''ll go to the Research Counter first to understand the core research task. Once I''ve understood the task, I''ll proceed to the Private Memory Room on the next turn.


  My response will start with an acknowledgement of the status change and new identity. Then I''ll explicitly state the plan, including the system''s advice, showing that I''m strategically evaluating the instructions. This will then be followed by the command to execute my first action.


  Reviewing, it accurately reflects my new status, clearly states my plan, follows system advice, and the command is formatted correctly. The response is concise, demonstrates comprehension, and executes the next logical step.

