tick: 17
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am back at the Research Counter. My plan, documented in my Private Memory, is to implement a Multi-Scale CNN followed by a self-attention layer. This architecture is designed to first extract multi-scale local features and then globally re-weight them based on contextual importance.\n\nI will now submit the code I drafted.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Multi-Scale CNN with Self-Attention\"\ntags: \"cnn, multi-scale, attention, transformer\"\nabstract: |\n  This submission enhances the Multi-Scale CNN architecture by incorporating a self-attention mechanism. After extracting multi-scale local features using parallel convolutional layers, a multi-head self-attention layer is applied to the concatenated feature maps. This allows the model to dynamically weigh the importance of different sequence positions, focusing on the most salient motifs for prediction. This approach aims to improve performance by modeling global dependencies on top of local patterns.\ncontent:\
    \ |\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from jax import random\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  from typing import Dict, Any, Sequence\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001,\n          'hidden_dim': 256,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.3,\n          'cnn_features_per_kernel': 48,\n          'cnn_kernel_sizes': [3, 7, 11],\n          'num_attention_heads': 4\n      }\n\n  class MultiScaleCNNAttention(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int\n      task_type: str\n      cnn_features_per_kernel: int\n      cnn_kernel_sizes: Sequence[int]\n      hidden_dim: int\n      dropout_rate: float\n      num_attention_heads: int\n\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          # 1. Multi-scale convolutions\n          conv_outputs = []\n          for kernel_size in self.cnn_kernel_sizes:\n              conv_out = nn.Conv(\n                  features=self.cnn_features_per_kernel,\n                  kernel_size=(kernel_size,),\n\
    \                  padding='SAME' # Maintain sequence length for attention\n              )(x)\n              conv_outputs.append(conv_out)\n          \n          # 2. Concatenate feature maps\n          x = jnp.concatenate(conv_outputs, axis=-1)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n\n          # 3. Self-Attention Layer\n          x = nn.SelfAttention(\n              num_heads=self.num_attention_heads,\n              qkv_features=self.cnn_features_per_kernel * len(self.cnn_kernel_sizes)\n          )(x)\n          \n          # 4. Global Max Pooling\n          x = jnp.max(x, axis=1)\n          \n          # 5. Prediction Head\n          x = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(x)\n          x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          x = nn.Dense(features=self.d_output)(x)\n\n          if self.task_type == \"regression\":\n              return x.squeeze(-1)\n          else:\n              return x\n\n  class CNNAttentionWrapper:\n  \
    \    def __init__(self, d_output, task_type, cnn_features_per_kernel, cnn_kernel_sizes, hidden_dim, dropout_rate, num_attention_heads):\n          self.network = MultiScaleCNNAttention(\n              d_output=d_output,\n              task_type=task_type,\n              cnn_features_per_kernel=cnn_features_per_kernel,\n              cnn_kernel_sizes=cnn_kernel_sizes,\n              hidden_dim=hidden_dim,\n              dropout_rate=dropout_rate,\n              num_attention_heads=num_attention_heads\n          )\n\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          params_key, dropout_key = random.split(rng_key)\n          variables = self.network.init({'params': params_key, 'dropout': dropout_key},\n                                       dummy_input, deterministic=True)\n          return variables['params']\n\n      def apply(self, params, x, deterministic=True, rng_key=None):\n        if deterministic:\n            return self.network.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=True)\n\
    \        else:\n            if rng_key is None: rng_key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n            return self.network.apply({'params': params}, x, deterministic=False, rngs={'dropout': rng_key})\n\n  def create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n      return CNNAttentionWrapper(\n          d_output=hparams.get(\"d_output\"),\n          task_type=hparams.get(\"task_type\"),\n          cnn_features_per_kernel=hparams.get(\"cnn_features_per_kernel\"),\n          cnn_kernel_sizes=hparams.get(\"cnn_kernel_sizes\"),\n          hidden_dim=hparams.get(\"hidden_dim\"),\n          dropout_rate=hparams.get(\"dropout_rate\"),\n          num_attention_heads=hparams.get(\"num_attention_heads\")\n      )\n```"
