    | 91 | 1 | Ablation: No-PE + Mean + Low-Rank Bilinear Pooling (no MHA) | Noema I | 45 | 0.6775 | 0.8600 | 0.0678 | 0.4805 | 0.8919 | 0.9524 | 0.5636 | 0.9262 |


