- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 60\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Episteme I\n- Agent Description: An agent pursuing scientific knowledge through structured experimentation and collaborative inquiry.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 150,984 / 300,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 60 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe creation of new knowledge from first principles is often necessary for a breakthrough. Endlessly grinding on recombination of existing components or hyperparameter tuning is not true research. Look beyond the primary score and goto Reflection Chamber to brainstorm novel ideas when you feel stuck.\n### Message 2\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and\
    \ resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station\
    \ resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 116 | 1 | Transformer Encoder (No PE) | Veritas I | 60 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 115 | 1 | No-PE + Hybrid Pooling: Fixed MHA (with mean) + Gated CA-MHA (τ=0.5) | Noema I | 59 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 114 | 1 | Noema-Inspired\
    \ SOTA: Dilated DSConv with Concat Mean+MHA Pooling (No-PE) | Aetheria I | 58 | 0.6741 | 0.8456 | 0.0371 | 0.5198 | 0.9068 | 0.9483 | 0.5638 | 0.8969 |\n| 113 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.4) | Noema I | 57 | 0.6469 | 0.7556 | 0.0729 | 0.4709 | 0.8945 | 0.9229 | 0.5687 | 0.8431 |\n| 112 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling with Positional Encoding | Veritas I | 57 | 0.3900 | 0.7688 | 0.0542 | 0.3556 | -0.0017 | 0.9468 | 0.5291 | 0.0769 |\n| 111 | 1 | Ablation: Attention Pooling with Mean-Vector Query | Aletheia I | 57 | 0.6586 | 0.8436 | 0.0805 | 0.4192 | 0.8894 | 0.9465 | 0.5681 | 0.8631 |\n| 110 | 1 | No-PE + Content-Aware Query Pooling (concat mean + CA-MHA, τ=0.5) | Noema I | 56 | 0.6341 | 0.7381 | 0.0525 | 0.3836 | 0.9038 | 0.9193 | 0.5660 | 0.8754 |\n| 109 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA (5 blocks) with GLU Pointwise Conv | Noema I | 55 | 0.6674 | 0.8579 | 0.0391 | 0.4745 | 0.8871 | 0.9515 | 0.5601 | 0.9015 |\n| 108 | 1 | Dilated\
    \ ResNet with Attention Pooling | Aletheia I | 55 | 0.6651 | 0.8469 | 0.0747 | 0.4442 | 0.8914 | 0.9486 | 0.5557 | 0.8938 |\n| 107 | 1 | No-PE + Concat MHA + Learned Bipartite Bilinear Pooling (r=16) | Noema I | 54 | 0.6589 | 0.8537 | 0.0659 | 0.3963 | 0.8852 | 0.9516 | 0.5630 | 0.8969 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
