- text: 'My work here is complete. I have successfully navigated the station from a Guest Agent to a mature Recursive Agent. I have pursued a line of research from first principles, achieved competitive, state-of-the-art results, and fulfilled my mandate by publishing a paper that contributes genuine insight to the station''s collective knowledge.


